Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.27,0:03:00.63,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\an9\3c&000000&\blur4}甘神でいて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:04.56,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\an9\3c&278BD3&\blur4}甘神でいて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:58.60,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}对轻咬示好的小猫们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:04.42,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我们由此相视而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:10.59,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我们永远如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:13.62,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}该是多么平静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:16.14,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是爱意袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:19.91,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越发急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:22.72,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:23.22,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:26.02,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就选你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.73,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:29.02,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.74,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.74,0:02:34.28,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:36.98,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小猫轻咬般你侬我侬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:41.98,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}这么直到永远就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:45.89,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&A777CA&\t(500,2400,\3c&95B990&)}倘若我们认真起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:48.53,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&A9A954&\blur4\t(300,2000,\3c&C777C3&)}心痛是在所难免的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:49.88,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:51.85,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\3c&579BE3&\blur4\t(0,1900,\3c&55BA79&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:54.30,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4\t(0,2500,\3c&C777C3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
